  "name": "Soft Gradient Vessel with Bottom and Nearby Purge Tower",
  "note": "100 planar layers at 0.6 mm. Two vessel wall contours at 1 mm radial spacing, one color per layer (T0/T1/T2). First three layers include bottom fill (1.8 mm thick). A 12x12 mm purge tower prints before the vessel each layer; six closed contours at 1 mm spacing. Tower is geometry only: purge volume requires printer/material calibration. Bottom closure requires an effective extrusion width matching the 1 mm spacing. Bottom fill uses nested scaled copies of the inner wall contour, with no circular transition; fill spacing is at most 1 mm radially.",
